        {
            "title": "澳洲退休金公司Challenger拒絕第一生命44億美元收購要約，股價下跌",
            "description": "<div class=\"atoms\" data-component=\"blocks\"><figure class=\"mb-module-gap\"><div class=\"mx-auto w-fit max-w-full\"><img alt=\"貝佐斯表示藍色起源IPO數年內可期，上市計劃合情合理\" class=\"rounded-lg\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"540\" src=\"https://s.yimg.com/lo/mysterio/api/cc0fc3635d7b271c4e280833a3698f3c184bfdc4298f847d8fe5eae1d3759106/lightyear_networkapi/resizefill_w960%3Bquality_80%3Bformat_webp/https%3A%2F%2Fcontent-media.investing.com%2Fnews%2FLYNXMPEA6U04V_M.jpg\" width=\"960\"/><figcaption class=\"text-px14 text-dolphin mt-2 wrap-anywhere\" style=\"max-width:960px\">貝佐斯表示藍色起源IPO數年內可期，上市計劃合情合理</figcaption></div></figure><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Investing.com — 澳洲退休收入提供商Challenger (ASX:CGF)週四表示，已拒絕日本第一生命控股 (TYO:8750) 提出的修訂收購要約，認為該提案在控制權易主的背景下低估了公司價值。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">第一生命旗下澳洲子公司TAL第一生命澳洲，就其尚未持有的Challenger 79.5%股份提出每股A$12.20的收購要約，整體交易估值約為65億澳元（44億美元）。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">此次出價較早前於10月遭拒的每股A$11.80要約高出40澳仙，但相對於Challenger前一交易日收盤價，溢價僅為2.1%。</p><div class=\"bg-toast-background -mx-5 -mt-2 mb-3 pb-3 md:-mx-0 lg:mx-auto lg:w-[300px] lg:pb-0\"><div class=\"text-px14 text-gandalf py-1 text-center leading-5\">廣告</div><div class=\"mx-auto text-center min-w-[300px] min-h-[250px]\" id=\"sda-inbody-58b9d864-624c-30c2-be2a-536b593da9eb-1-iframe\"><div class=\"bg-dirty-seagull text-px12 text-dolphin mx-auto hidden items-center justify-center only:flex w-[300px] h-[250px]\">廣告</div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">在悉尼上市的Challenger股價收跌1.8%，報A$11.74，創下近四週以來的最低收盤價。</p><div class=\"recommendation-contents\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mb-2 h-[30px] w-[80px] rounded-lg\"></div><div class=\"no-scrollbar -mx-5 mb-5 flex overflow-hidden overflow-x-auto md:-mx-2 lg:mb-3.5\"><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mr-2 ml-5 h-[94px] w-[calc(85%-28px)] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg md:ml-2 md:w-[calc(85%-16px)] lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow mx-2 h-[94px] w-[85%] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:w-[300px]\"></div><div class=\"bg-marshmallow hidden h-[94px] w-[300px] flex-shrink-0 rounded-lg lg:block\"></div></div></div><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\">Challenger表示，董事會在財務及法律顧問的協助下，已審慎考慮這份不具約束力的有條件收購提案，但最終認定該要約未能充分體現對股東而言的公平價值。</p><p class=\"mb-module-gap break-words leading-[1.4] text-px20 lg:text-px18 lg:leading-[1.8] text-batcave\"><em>此文章由人工智能協助翻譯。更多資訊，請參閱我們的使用條款。</em></p></div>",
